9. **Separating the Issues:** "If this goes to trial, what questions will the judge likely ask to ensure the jury (or the judge themselves) separates the personal injury damages from our existing divorce/custody financial arrangements?"
10. **Impact on Custody:** "Is there any risk that the outcome of this personal injury trial, or the medical/financial records revealed during it, could be used to modify our current custody or support agreements?"

**Next Steps**
